Trademarks
----------

TALQ is a trademark of the TALQ Consortium. This module is not made,
endorsed, certified or supported by the TALQ Consortium and is not
affiliated with it; TALQ certification needs consortium membership and
was not done. The name is used only to say which protocol the module
implements.

Specifications
--------------

- TALQ OpenAPI definitions 2.7.1 (CMS API, gateway API, data model),
  github.com/TALQ-consortium/TALQ_specification, commit
  b05f9a2c8df945fceab5f47c0ebc045724dc77e0, BSD-3-Clause (Copyright the
  TALQ Consortium). operations_gen.go lists the operation ids, methods,
  paths and response codes of the two API files, extracted by a script;
  these are facts every implementation must use. No OpenAPI file and no
  description text is included.
- TALQ Smart City Protocol specification 2.7.1 (approved version), from
  the same repository: used for facts only; no text is reproduced.

Dependencies
------------

The Go standard library only (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors).

